from 975,134's ten thousands). 3+7=10. So that gives 0 in ten thousands and carryover 1. That seems right.\n\nThen the hundred thousands place: 7 (from first number) +9 (second) =16, plus 1 is 17. So 7 in hundred thousands and carryover 1 to millions. So yes, that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 1,705,152.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 730018 and 975134 is \\boxed{1705152}.\n"]
