s digit is 1 (from the carryover). .\n\nSo combining all digits:.\n\nMillions:1,.\n\nHundred thousands:1,.\n\nTen thousands:8,.\n\nThousands:6,.\n\nHundreds:6,.\n\nTens:9,.\n\nOnes:9. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
