7, plus the 1 carried is 18 → write 8, carry 1.\n\nThousands: 8 (from first number) + 7 (from second number) = 15, plus 1 → 16 → write 6, carry 1.\n\nTen thousands: 0 + 8 = 8, plus 1 → 9 → write 9, no carry.\n\nHundred thousands: 1 + 6 =7 → write 7.\n\nSo combining all digits: 7 (hundred thousands), 9 (ten thousands), 6 (thousands), 8 (hundreds), 4 (tens), 6 (ones). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
