natively, maybe I can add them in another way to verify.\n\n536,924 + 698,321.\n\nLet me break them into parts. \n\n500,000 + 600,000 = 1,100,000\n\n36,000 + 98,000 = 134,000\n\n924 + 321 = 1,245\n\nAdding all together: 1,100,000 +134,000 = 1,234,000; then +1,245 gives 1,235,245. Yep, same result. Okay, so I think that's correct.\n\nSo the answer should be 1,235,245.\n</think>\n\n",
