ns: 6 +4 =10 +1=11 → 1, carry 1.\n\nHundreds: 0 +9 =9 +1=10 → 0, carry1.\n\nThousands: 5 +5=10 +1=11 → 1, carry1.\n\nTen-thousands: 4 +1=5 +1=6 → 6, no carry.\n\nHundred-thousands:7 +7=14 → 14.\n\nSo combining all the digits: 14 (hundred-thousands), 6 (ten-thousands), 1 (thousands), 0 (hundreds), 1 (tens), 0 (ones). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
