sands place: 3 + 0 = 3. Write down 3.\n6. The hundred thousands place: 6 + 9 = 15. Write down 5, carry over 1.\n7. The millions place: 1 (carry). Write down 1.\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is 1539722.\n"]
